            %p
              Now, since the only non-
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/identity+morphism"} identity
              morphisms in
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
